      "raw": "<p>Hm, now I see what throws me off, it&#39;s the `do&#39; instead of `did&#39;. If it just said `if you did, destroy this card&#39;, it would be crystal clear to me, but it uses `do&#39; instead. Why? WHY? There must be a reason! I MUST UNDERSTAND. What motivated The Creators?!</p><p>...ahem</p><p>I&#39;d like you to be right. But the `if you do&#39; sounds a bit like a triggered thing? Or doesn&#39;t it? Ugh, I just don&#39;t know.</p>",
